<title>UK: EIB sets 500 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 500 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.06    PAY DATE  S-07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.71     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMANY   MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC   1.35</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT SEP 2003 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
